SUMMARY:Impromptu D Ride - Brownstown Akron Farmersville Long (24F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n## Details\n\nRide begins
  at\nWest Earl Township Municipal Building\n157 W. Metzler Rd.\nEphrata\, 
 PA\n\nRide leader: Judy Wells\nSweep: open\nCue and GPX link: https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/19839840\nThis is a Casual (D) level group ride with an
  average of pace 12-14 mph. The intent of this and all LBC rides is to be 
 safe\, have fun\, stay together.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Pleas
 e bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 
 inflator).\nWe require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP to join this ri
 de.\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.[Join the Club](h
 ttps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n
 Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's:\n[Code of Conduct](htt
 ps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&m
 odule_id=323984)\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com
 /content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\n[Ride Waiver](h
 ttps://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=763523)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3142985
 04/
