SUMMARY:ACCR Adopt a Highway All Club Ride
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nThese are the April All Club Rides after the Adopt 
 a Highway Event. Following the ride\, please join us at [Raney Cellars Bre
 wing Co](https://www.raneycellarsbrewing.com/) for food\, drinks and fello
 wship.\n\nA&B rides will use this route: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub
 .net/cue/mm-memorial-day-meander-34h/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/cue/mm-memorial-day-meander-34h/)\n\nC&D rides will use this route: [htt
 ps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/mm-tick-tock-trek-reversed-23r/](htt
 ps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/mm-tick-tock-trek-reversed-23r/)\n\n
 The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed for the [Ride Cl
 assifications](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_
 id=257148&module_id=325156). This is intended to be a group ride with a no
 -drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep 
 the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be a
 ppointed at the start.\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willin
 g to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be ridi
 ng by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining the a
 dvertised average pace is beyond your current ability level\, please consi
 der joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Ple
 ase bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO
 2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we re
 quire LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being o
 n Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](h
 ttps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n
 \nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Cod
 e of Conduct](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Ac
 tions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3140430
